& [ContextSolution] projects exact runtime authority
  + CoordinationToolContext carries catalogue procedure IR admission request and initial session only
  + conversion from successful AuthorshipLaneEvidence omits candidate validation compilation prior outcome replay and stable-session history
  + boxed large forms reduce Rust enum stack size without changing serialized JSON shape

& [DispatchSolution] has one semantic implementation
  + strict internally tagged BEGIN calls begin_coordination_checkpoint
  + strict internally tagged ADVANCE calls advance_coordination_checkpoint after a positive-quota gate
  + core faults become bounded category-preserving transport faults with no successor result
  + successful results contain the exact core checkpoint or transition and equal inputs replay byte-identically

& [McpSolution] is one stateless local transport
  + cantor-coordination-mcp advertises exactly step_procedure_coordination over STDIO
  + complete request state enters under request and the complete response exits under structuredContent
  + text is a short nonauthoritative summary
  + metadata is read-only non-destructive idempotent and closed-world and ingress is capped at 32 MiB

& [InferenceSolution] uses ordinary staged tool calling
  + a host finishes one model pass or applies deterministic policy before calling Cantor
  + the host may place the returned structuredContent in the next inference pass
  + no llama.cpp patch token insertion KV-cache access hidden-state sharing or live forward-pass mutation is required

& [OperationalRepair] closes a workspace-only lint fault
  + Windows-only runtime-contract test imports and fixture constant now share the existing cfg(windows) boundary
  + Windows behavior and test content are unchanged while warnings-denied Linux Clippy becomes truthful

& [Boundary] is callable checkpoint P0
  + no retained custody persistence authentication provider invocation automatic registration prompt policy external effect or model-choice guarantee is added
  + checkpoint content binding remains distinct from producer identity and semantic truth

